-wiki/2022/01/24/50494840/d3a9392b4503a833316fcd46379d94eb_4538153940743966559.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">被动提高全伤，主动技有着可观的火伤，并具有一定的辅助能力；</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">火伤输出向镰刀武器，其他属性的角色使用时仅可享受普攻全伤加成；</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">缭乱星棘使用时能造成额外造成的火伤，被动技改善循环流程。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/01/24/50494840/d3a9392b4503a833316fcd46379d94eb_4538153940743966559.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
